keyword:
	keyword: Splinter
	match: Splinter <atom-param>cost</atom-param>
	reminder: Whenever this attacks, pay the splinter cost to create a tapped and attacking token copy of this without splinter. It gains "At the beginning of your end step, sacrifice this token."
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Gear token
	match: Gear toke<atom-param>*s</atom-param>
	reminder: {if param1.value == "ns" then "They’re artifacts" else "It’s an artifact"} with "T, Sacrifice this token: Untap target nonland permanent. Activate only as a sorcery."
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Chrono counters
	match: you get
	reminder: Once each turn as a sorcery, you can spend chrono counters to take an extra step or phase this turn.
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Flux
	match: Flux <atom-param>number</atom-param> — <atom-param>one_word</atom-param>
	reminder: On your upkeep, put a time counter on this. Whenever there are {english_number_a(param1)} or more, remove {english_number_a(param1)} and trigger the flux ability.
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Traverse
	match: Traverse <atom-param>number</atom-param>
	reminder: Tap any number of creatures you control with total power {param1} or more: Traverse this Path, then sacrifice it. Traverse only as a sorcery.
	rules: 
	mode: custom
keyword:
	keyword: Treasure token
	match: Treasure toke<atom-param>*s</atom-param>
	reminder: {handle_merged_rt(if param1.value == "ns" then "They’re artifacts" else "It’s an artifact", moved:"A Treasure token is an artifact")} with "T, Sacrifice this token: Add one mana of any color."
	rules: 
	mode: core
